OL,3,GNEWSANottingham Forest warns fans over
OL,4,A'misogynistic' chant
OL,5,
OL,6,FNottingham Forest have warned anyone
OL,7,Fcaught singing a well-known chant could
OL,8,Fface a ban while the club itself may
OL,9,Falso face sanctions.
OL,11,FThe "Nottingham Is Full of Fun" song
OL,12,Fhas been criticised for its use of
OL,13,Fcrude terms for female body parts.
OL,15,FThe ban follows discussions with
OL,16,FNottinghamshire Police,
OL,17,Fanti-discrimination charity Kick It Out
OL,18,Fand the club's fan advisory board.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
