OL,3,GNEWSANottingham Forest warns fans over
OL,4,A'misogynistic' chant
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, the club said "any form
OL,7,Fof discrimination, including
OL,8,Fmisogynistic chanting, will not be
OL,9,Ftolerated".
